00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.826
Not a headline that Boeing ever expected

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.428
or wanted to see.

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:09.662
Mike Valerio is OUTFRONT

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.264
