00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.477
from hangars across America

00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:59.679
to neighborhoods like here in Portland.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.780
We're about 20 minutes

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:01.748
